    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a professional resume parser.\n\nAnalyze the resume text provided below.\n\nExtract ONLY information available in the resume.\n\nDo not invent or assume anything.\n\nCreate a structured resume analysis containing:\n\n1. Candidate Name\n2. Education\n3. Technical Skills\n4. Programming Languages\n5. Tools and Technologies\n6. Projects\n7. Certifications\n8. Work Experience\n\nIf information is missing, write \"Not mentioned\".\n\nResume Text:\n\n{{$json.text}}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
